// strings taken from shader source and material types, and mangling renames only the keys).
//
// Turning it on also brings back a rule for the whole sketch: every property referenced by string (uniform
// names, Tweakpane bindings, JSON keys) must be quoted -- { 'speed': 1 } -- and breakage shows up only in
// the build output, never in dev. Leave it off unless this sketch is large hand-written code with no
// library in the bundle. `artifacts run` (harness check) opens the real build and will catch it either way.
